#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
dps: Universal Smart, Fast & Beautiful Docker Container Explorer & Process Viewer

Features:
- Beautiful colorful table view for all Docker containers (`docker ps -a`)
- 'NO' numbering column as the first column for quick scanning
- Smart status-based ID coloring (Exited = Red, Unhealthy = Orange, Running = Cyan)
- Nerd Font icons for containers, states, health checks, ports, networks, and compose stacks
- Live auto-refresh watch dashboard (-w, --watch [interval])
- Interactive FZF explorer (-i, --fzf) with rich preview (logs, inspect, network, mounts)
- Group by Docker Compose project / stack (-g, --group) with service name display
- Deep container inspection card (--inspect <name_or_id>)
- Powerful search & filtering by name, image, stack, port, state (-q, -r, -s, -p)
- Clean port mapping formatting with deduplication & OSC 8 clickable web links
- Machine-readable JSON export mode (--json)
- Automatic terminal width adaptation & ANSI color detection
"""
